   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome Indicator 1.1: Increased public resources allocation for SDG high impact projects
Outcome Indicator 1.2: Adoption intergovernmental fiscal formula by Fiscal Commission

Output Indicators:
1.1.1.Project selection criteria for MTEF streamlined with SDGs
1.1.2 No of provinces and LGUs that develop SDG- aligned MTEF
1.2.1 Criteria for integrating SDGs in intergovernmental fiscal transfer framework
1.3.1.Guidelines for SDG budget coding
1.3.2 No of expenditure tracking reports available</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2022">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Not available
2. Not adopted
1.1.1 zero
1.1.2 zero
1.2.1 Not available
1.3.1 Not available
1.3.2 Not available</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Resource book for SDGs based MTEF drafted and submitted to MOFAGA for final approval
2. Number of provincial governments and local governments that have prepared MTEF
3. Guideline for SDG budget code</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.	SDG Responsive Medium Term Expenditure Framework (MTEF) Preparation Resource Book for Local Government is prepared and it is rolled out in local governments
2.	SDG Budget Coding Resource Book for Local Governments is Prepared and it is rolled out in local governments 
3.	750 local government officials are trained to prepare SDG responsive MTEF preparation and SDG budget coding in local level budgeting. Additional 750 local government officials will be trained in 2022  
4.	SDG responsive MTEF of 5 provinces are prepared 
5.	SDG responsive MTEF of 14 local governments (as model) are prepared 
6.	SDG voluntary local review report (SDG VLR) of 14 local governments (as model) are being prepared 
7.	SDG based public expenditure tracking survey of 7 provinces are in process.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
